      "claim": "Chilonis's husband is Cleonymus.",
      "answer": "Cleonymus",
      "quote": "[ 2 ] Chilonis preferred death to a return to her husband ; in Plutarch 's account of the battle , she kept a rope tied around her neck ready to commit suicide in the case of defeat .",
      "original_document_number": 2
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "ramdocs-0158-581f7e1afea2:d03",
